{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":2,"title":"문자열 뒤집기","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>를 뒤집어 돌려주는 <code>reverse_string(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def reverse_string(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def reverse_string(s):\n    return s[::-1]\n","hint":"<p>슬라이싱 <code>s[::-1]</code> 은 처음부터 끝까지를 -1칸씩 이동해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"reverse_string(\"abc\")","expected":"cba","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_string(\"\")","expected":"","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_string(\"racecar\")","expected":"racecar","visible":false},{"call":"reverse_string(\"Hello\")","expected":"olleH","visible":false}],"id":"py-042"}